      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Small bowel intussusception, presenting acutely in adults is an extremely rare event. We present an exceptional case, previously unreported in the English language, of a lipoma within a Meckel's diverticulum giving rise to this clinical scenario."},
